    "detailed_description": "Cel mai blanao joc din 2021 (nu chiar) (ba chiar defel).<br><br>Porne\u0219te \u00eentr-o aventur\u0103 scurt\u0103 de uitat \u00een maxim 30min dup\u0103 ce ai \u00eenchis jocul! Ce mai a\u0219tep\u021bi?<br>Aventura \u00eel urm\u0103re\u0219te pe Copilul Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t \u00eentr-o lume bizar\u0103, seara.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530140/extras/36b57084936bcee481ca2755b598b0aa.avif?t=1612806045\" /></div><br><br>Era o dup\u0103-amiaz\u0103 lini\u0219tit\u0103, c\u00e2nd dintr-o dat\u0103 o explozie de pule a distrus lumea. Vai vai! Ce mai putem face?<br>Noroc c\u0103 exist\u0103 EL! -&gt; Copilul Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t \u00een ac\u021biune (dup\u0103 ce ai citit asta imagineaz\u0103-\u021bi o pies\u0103 de supererou)<br><br>Al\u0103turi de Copilul Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t, va trebui s\u0103-\u021bi g\u0103se\u0219ti calea \u00een aceast\u0103 lume ciudat\u0103 creat\u0103 de mintea bolnav\u0103 a lui Codrin Bradea. (\u00ee\u021bi dai seama)<br>Jocul const\u0103 \u00een dialoguri ciudate cu personaje ciudate, iar datoria ta, urm\u0103rind povestea, (care exist\u0103) este s\u0103 iei cele mai bune decizii. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Trebuie s\u0103 supravie\u021buie\u0219ti, c\u0103ci post-apocalips\u0103, probabil to\u021bi cei cu care te vei \u00eent\u00e2lni \u00ee\u021bi vor t\u0103ia g\u00e2\u021bii<br></li><li>  Trebuie s\u0103 g\u0103se\u0219ti de m\u00e2ncare, c\u0103ci dup\u0103 explozie, resursele sunt limitate<br></li><li>  Trebuie s\u0103-\u021bi g\u0103se\u0219ti p\u0103rin\u021bii demult pierdu\u021bi care nici nu \u0219tiai c\u0103 exist\u0103 \u0219i nici eu n-am \u0219tiut p\u00e2n\u0103 la jum\u0103tatea jocului \u00een timp ce-l f\u0103ceam<br></li><li>  Trebuie s\u0103 d\u0336i\u0336s\u0336t\u0336r\u0336u\u0336g\u0336i\u0336 \u0336l\u0336u\u0336m\u0336e\u0336a\u0336. (sau oare?). </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  2 Good Endings, 1 Bad Ending, 3\u0336 \u0336S\u0336e\u0336c\u0336r\u0336e\u0336t\u0336 \u0336E\u0336n\u0336d\u0336i\u0336n\u0336g\u0336s\u0336 \u0336p\u0336e\u0336 \u0336c\u0336a\u0336r\u0336e\u0336 \u0336n\u0336u\u0336 \u0336o\u0336 \u0336s\u0336\u0103\u0336 \u0336l\u0336e\u0336 \u0336g\u0336\u0103\u0336s\u0336i\u0336\u021b\u0336i\u0336 \u0336n\u0336i\u0336c\u0336i\u0336o\u0336d\u0336a\u0336t\u0336\u0103\u0336 </li></ul><br>Dar aten\u021bie. C\u0103ile pe care le vei alege te vor \u00eempiedica s\u0103 faci toate aceste lucruri deodat\u0103.<br>Deci trebuie s\u0103-\u021bi alegi o singur\u0103 cale. (sau s\u0103 joci jocu de mai multe ori lmao \u0219i a\u0219a nu dureaz\u0103 mult)<br><br>\u0218i uite a\u0219a, soarta Copilului Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t se afl\u0103 \u00een m\u00e2inile tale.<br><br><br>Pros:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> E pixelat<br></li><li> E fain</li></ul>Cons:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Efectiv nu are gameplay trebuie doar s\u0103 iei decizii<br></li><li> E f\u0103cut de mine<br></li><li> Nu are voci, poate urm\u0103toarele<br></li><li> Dureaz\u0103 destul de pu\u021bin (ca mine)</li></ul><br>Add to wishlist now.",
    "about_the_game": "Cel mai blanao joc din 2021 (nu chiar) (ba chiar defel).<br><br>Porne\u0219te \u00eentr-o aventur\u0103 scurt\u0103 de uitat \u00een maxim 30min dup\u0103 ce ai \u00eenchis jocul! Ce mai a\u0219tep\u021bi?<br>Aventura \u00eel urm\u0103re\u0219te pe Copilul Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t \u00eentr-o lume bizar\u0103, seara.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1530140/extras/36b57084936bcee481ca2755b598b0aa.avif?t=1612806045\" /></div><br><br>Era o dup\u0103-amiaz\u0103 lini\u0219tit\u0103, c\u00e2nd dintr-o dat\u0103 o explozie de pule a distrus lumea. Vai vai! Ce mai putem face?<br>Noroc c\u0103 exist\u0103 EL! -&gt; Copilul Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t \u00een ac\u021biune (dup\u0103 ce ai citit asta imagineaz\u0103-\u021bi o pies\u0103 de supererou)<br><br>Al\u0103turi de Copilul Albastru \u0219i Ur\u00e2t, va trebui s\u0103-\u021bi g\u0103se\u0219ti calea \u00een aceast\u0103 lume ciudat\u0103 creat\u0103 de mintea bolnav\u0103 a lui Codrin Bradea. (\u00ee\u021bi dai seama)<br>Jocul const\u0103 \u00een dialoguri ciudate cu personaje ciudate, iar datoria ta, urm\u0103rind povestea, (care exist\u0103) este s\u0103 iei cele mai bune decizii. <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Trebuie s\u0103 supravie\u021buie\u0219ti, c\u0103ci post-apocalips\u0103, probabil to\u021bi cei cu care te vei \u00eent\u00e2lni \u00ee\u021bi vor t\u0103ia g\u00e2\u021bii<br></li><li>  Trebuie s\u0103 g\u0103se\u0219ti de m\u00e2ncare, c\u0103ci dup\u0103 explozie, resursele sunt limitate<br></li><li>  Trebuie s\u0103-\u021bi g\u0103se\u0219ti p\u0103rin\u021bii demult pierdu\u021bi care nici nu \u0219tiai c\u0103 exist\u0103 \u0219i nici eu n-am \u0219tiut p\u00e2n\u0103 la jum\u0103tatea jocului \u00een timp ce-l f\u0103ceam<br></li><li>  Trebuie s\u0103 d\u0336i\u0336s\u0336t\u0336r\u0336u\u0336g\u0336i\u0336 \u0336l\u0336u\u0336m\u0336e\u0336a\u0336. (sau oare?). </li></ul><ul class=\